OL,3,GNEWSAFire crews urge care over aiming
OL,4,Afireworks safely
OL,5,
OL,6,FPeople are being urged to pay attention
OL,7,Fto where fireworks are aimed as part of
OL,8,Fa safety warning ahead of Bonfire
OL,9,FNight.
OL,11,FMerseyside Fire and Rescue Service
OL,12,F(MFRS) has warned careless firework use
OL,13,Fcan cause serious damage to people and
OL,14,Fproperties.
OL,16,FLast year a woman was seriously injured
OL,17,Fin Huyton when a rocket was fired at a
OL,18,Fblock of flats and a house in Kirkby
OL,19,Fwas also destroyed by a "stray
OL,20,Ffirework", MFRS said.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,406,400,260,160,0,100
