OL,3,GNEWSAFire crews urge care over aiming
OL,4,Afireworks safely
OL,5,
OL,6,FCraig Whitfield from MFRS said
OL,7,Ffireworks could be "extremely
OL,8,Fdangerous" as they are "designated as
OL,9,Fexplosives" and he urged people to take
OL,10,Fsafety precautions.
